  ("The formulas in a proof can be rearranged so that all axioms appear in the" 0.2282 0.8730 0.5021 0.5155 0.5155 0.0134 0.0074 0.2395 0.0329)
  ("beginning of the sequence. For example, the above proof can be rewritten as the" 0.1812 0.8730 0.5217 0.5351 0.5351 0.0134 0.0075 0.2197 0.0813)
